WEBVTT

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:43.810
Ngan!

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:46.170
Ani-ue.

00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:49.360
No, traitor Shunan.

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:51.800
Only a man of loyalty is meant to be the Grand Duke.

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:58.120
I will not let that name be defiled as a traitor!

00:00:58.120 --> 00:00:59.930
Save Shunan-sama!

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:05.410
Ngan-sama will be the new Grand Duke!

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:11.730
Ngan...

00:01:12.710 --> 00:01:14.770
You are mistaken!

00:01:16.210 --> 00:01:17.680
Shunan!

00:01:18.360 --> 00:01:20.140
Someone save Shunan!

00:01:26.150 --> 00:01:27.820
I will go.

00:01:29.510 --> 00:01:33.180
If it means I can save a precious life.

00:01:50.600 --> 00:01:51.920
Lilan, go.

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:03.000
Go to where he is.

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:45.070
Beast Renditioner

00:03:52.910 --> 00:03:54.250
Shunan!

00:04:06.180 --> 00:04:07.960
Traitor Shunan!

00:04:07.960 --> 00:04:09.140
Prepare for your death!

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:16.640
This is... the gods'...

00:05:18.740 --> 00:05:22.610
The power Founding Queen Je had?

00:05:28.120 --> 00:05:29.870
That's enough!

00:05:32.080 --> 00:05:34.250
Stop, Lilan!

00:05:36.590 --> 00:05:37.340
I said stop!

00:05:38.490 --> 00:05:40.920
If you won't, I'll blow the mute whistle!

00:06:22.030 --> 00:06:26.390
Hundreds of Touda went down instantly...

00:06:28.890 --> 00:06:32.200
Shoot the arrows at that beast-lord!

00:06:45.790 --> 00:06:49.070
Lilan, go to where that man is.

00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:54.750
Go!  Lilan!

00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:06.900
A-A beast-lord?

00:07:10.520 --> 00:07:11.390
Please follow me!

00:07:13.640 --> 00:07:16.620
Protect Shunan-sama from the beast-lord!

00:07:20.590 --> 00:07:21.420
Who are you?

00:07:21.420 --> 00:07:24.250
I am Queen Seimiya's subject.

00:07:30.120 --> 00:07:32.330
Please hurry on!

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:07.830
Go, Lilan...

00:08:12.680 --> 00:08:15.080
Go!  Lilan!

00:08:36.850 --> 00:08:38.120
Go...

00:09:20.110 --> 00:09:21.270
Go!

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:28.230
Go, Lilan!

00:09:58.800 --> 00:10:00.100
Lilan...

00:11:05.910 --> 00:11:08.290
I wanted to get to know you.

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:11.040
That's all I cared about.

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:19.550
I haven't gotten to see you leading a happy life like you wish for.

00:11:20.620 --> 00:11:26.930
I've yet to hear your voice in the wild.

00:11:31.060 --> 00:11:32.040
Erin.

00:11:32.710 --> 00:11:33.680
Live.

00:11:35.620 --> 00:11:39.560
Live, and find your happiness.

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:53.650
M... om...

00:12:19.400 --> 00:12:20.710
Shunan!

00:12:20.710 --> 00:12:23.410
Hurry and send a horse down!

00:12:23.410 --> 00:12:25.050
The beast-lord handler is still there!

00:12:44.060 --> 00:12:45.990
Someone get Erin!

00:12:45.990 --> 00:12:47.800
Someone save Erin!

00:12:50.510 --> 00:12:51.960
Save Erin!

00:12:56.200 --> 00:12:58.840
I want to live!

00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:39.650
Mom.

00:15:10.860 --> 00:15:12.240
Lilan...

00:15:17.790 --> 00:15:19.000
Why did you...

00:15:22.260 --> 00:15:25.110
You came to save me?

00:15:53.250 --> 00:15:58.290
She and the beast-lord are tied with a strong bond, like a family's.

00:16:12.710 --> 00:16:17.990
Will we humans be able to create a bond as strong as theirs?

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:23.930
Will you and I be able to create such a strong bond?

00:16:28.240 --> 00:16:29.780
I don't know.

00:16:29.780 --> 00:16:37.610
But because we're at a distance, and since we're two separate people, nothing will start unless we both reach out.

00:16:40.310 --> 00:16:42.790
Isn't that right, Shunan?

00:16:43.930 --> 00:16:47.490
Shunan, I will accept you.

00:16:47.490 --> 00:16:51.400
But I will never lose the mindset of despising war.

00:16:53.490 --> 00:17:00.850
However, the path you're about to take is one on which you must keep your eyes on reality, not dreams.

00:17:01.640 --> 00:17:03.990
Let us find that path.

00:17:03.990 --> 00:17:04.900
Together.

00:17:05.430 --> 00:17:06.250
Yes.

00:17:06.850 --> 00:17:07.980
With the two of us.

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:28.150
Seimiya...

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:38.370
I won't let that happen.

00:17:40.890 --> 00:17:42.750
Seimiya...

00:17:43.940 --> 00:17:45.150
Uncle...

00:18:24.140 --> 00:18:29.480
I will stand by a riverbank at the bottom of a deep valley and play the harp.

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:38.810
I will pluck one string at a time for all the beasts in the wild, so as to speak with them.

00:18:39.890 --> 00:18:43.040
I'll do so in order to hear a new melody.

00:18:45.760 --> 00:18:55.200
When the two forces collided, the country became warped, and a dark maelstrom consumed the many beasts and people.

00:18:56.270 --> 00:19:01.010
The codes designed to protect people became chains which tied them down,

00:19:01.010 --> 00:19:05.310
and the beasts' lives were tampered with for the humans' sake.

00:19:07.760 --> 00:19:17.700
Even through that maelstrom, all the effort one girl put into classifying what people are and what beasts are

00:19:17.700 --> 00:19:22.860
made a chance for people to reach out to each other.

00:19:37.540 --> 00:19:41.110
A traveling medicine man, huh?  How rare.

00:19:41.110 --> 00:19:47.290
Yes.  I hoped a man such as myself with some medical knowledge might be of help to someone.

00:20:06.450 --> 00:20:07.810
Owl.

00:20:13.760 --> 00:20:15.000
Jessie!

00:20:16.070 --> 00:20:17.390
Mom!

00:20:24.180 --> 00:20:25.220
Mom!

00:20:32.800 --> 00:20:33.900
Jessie.

00:20:36.020 --> 00:20:44.180
The wings I once had on my back are now gone with you.
senaka ni atta tsubasa wa kimi to tomo ni nakushita

00:20:44.180 --> 00:20:44.420
The memories of the days where I was able to fly won't go away as easily as scratches.
tobeta koro no kioku wa surikizu no you ni wa kiete kurenai

00:20:44.420 --> 00:20:52.630
tobeta koro no kioku wa surikizu no you ni wa kiete kurenai
The memories of the days where I was able to fly won't go away as easily as scratches.

00:21:00.050 --> 00:21:08.110
"I will get you back." That was all I ever thought.
kimi wo torimodosu sore bakari kangaete ita

00:21:08.110 --> 00:21:08.300
It was all to prevent myself from being swept away by the rushing time.
toki no dakuryuu ni oshi nagasarete shimawanu yo

00:21:08.300 --> 00:21:15.790
toki no dakuryuu ni oshi nagasarete shimawanu yo
