Memories won't speak to you. They won't leave you with a rope to grab onto.
omoide wa nani mo kataranai sugaritsuku ate mo nai

00:21:16.110 --> 00:21:23.720
omoide wa nani mo kataranai sugaritsuku ate mo nai
