The night all of a sudden shattered. The light scattered all over the sky.
totsuzen yoru ga hajiketa hikari ga sora ni tobichitta

00:21:38.200 --> 00:21:46.090
totsuzen yoru ga hajiketa hikari ga sora ni tobichitta
